ne. Party coordination, including door-knocking support from the Donalds camp, adds to her organizational edge. Eight of ten professional raters call the race Likely Republican, two call it Lean Republican, and prediction markets price Democrats below one-in-five.\n\nThe polling picture is thin: an October Democratic-sponsored survey put Gruters up four, while an earlier independent poll showed Kirschner narrowly ahead. Kirschner has shown some cross-party appeal, including an endorsement from Manatee County Republicans, and a favorable national environment could narrow the gap. Still, the combination of district lean, money, and expert consensus points to a Republican edge.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.257, "margin": -3.74}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2349, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1906, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2331, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1854, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1943, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2766, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2403, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2304, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1856, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2293, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2161, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1956, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2245, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.1476, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1845, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2054, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.1344, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.1177, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.1473, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.1655, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2056, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.1774, "margin"